<title>SLOVAKIA: TENNIS-SLOVAKIA LEAD CANADA 2-0 IN FED CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SLOVAKIA LEAD CANADA 2-0 IN FED CUP.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia lead Canada 2-0</p>
<p>after the opening singles of their Federation Cup World Group</p>
<p>Two regional qualifying play-off on Saturday.</p>
<p>Results (Slovak names first)</p>
<p>Karina Habsudova beat Rene Simpson 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Henrieta Nagyova beat Patricia Hy-Boulais 6-4 6-3</p>
